# {{.Name}}

A RemnaCore per-shop Telegram bot plugin built on the guest SDK.

## Build

```sh
./build.sh
# or: GOOS=wasip1 GOARCH=wasm GOWORK=off go build -buildmode=c-shared -trimpath -o {{.Name}}.wasm .
```

## Install & enable

```sh
vpnctl plugin install ./{{.Name}}.wasm
vpnctl plugin enable {{.Name}}
```

A shop owner then selects this plugin as their bot in the admin/reseller UI.

## Permissions

Edit `plugin.toml` `[permissions].grants` to match the ops your bot calls
(`telegram:send`, `users:write`, `billing:read`, `payment:write`,
`billing:write`). See the botsdk README for the full op → permission table.
